# Private research
#
# The MNMA design and evaluation documents. Kept on disk, out of the repository —
# they are personal research notes rather than anything a contributor needs, and
# the code that implements them stands on its own.
#
# Two things worth knowing about this entry:
#
# 1. .gitignore does not untrack anything. These were removed with
#    `git rm --cached` first; the pattern only stops them coming back.
# 2. They remain in history, added 2026-07-30. `git log --all -- MNMA.md` still
#    finds them. Removing them from history would rewrite every commit from that
#    date, which is nearly the whole repository, and break the v0.1.x tags. Not
#    done, because they contain no credentials and no personal data — this is a
#    publishing preference, not a leak.
docs/research/MNMA.md
docs/research/MNMA_RESEARCH.md
docs/research/MOCHI_BRAIN.md
